# Copy to .env.local (ignored by git via *.local).
#
# Base URL of the hosted runtime. Not a secret. Leave empty for the SDK default
# (http://localhost:8787).
VITE_AOC_RUNTIME_BASE_URL=

# There is intentionally NO API key variable. The hosted runtime key is a
# principal-bound secret and must never be compiled into the browser bundle.
# See src/lib/runtimeClient.ts.
